{"public_contract":{"description":"This market will settle to Yes if the rate of real U.S. GDP growth for 2026 is above 2.2%. Outcome sourced from the Bureau of Economic Analysis. 

The rate of real U.S. GDP growth for 2026 refers to the comparison between the annual level of GDP for 2025 and the annual level of GDP for 2026. Settlement is based on the Q4 Advance Estimate GDP release published by the BEA, currently scheduled for early 2027. Any subsequent revisions to this figure will not be considered for settlement purposes.

If the figure is not published on the scheduled date, the first officially published figure for the rate of real U.S. GDP growth in 2026 will be used. If no qualifying GDP figure is released within three months of the Advance Estimate GDP scheduled release date, this market will resolve based on data from the most recent previous release with available data.","endDate":"2027-02-13T04:00:00Z","question":"US GDP Growth in 2026?","title":"Above 2.2%"},"schema":"public-market-text/v1"}

{"public_contract":{"close_time":"2027-07-01T03:59:00Z","rules_primary":"If Keiko Fujimori leaves as President of Peru before Jul 1, 2027, then the market resolves to Yes.","rules_secondary":"This market will resolve based on the announcement date, regardless of effective date. An acknowledgement that they will leave office due solely to the scheduled expiration of a constitutionally or legally mandated term limit does not satisfy the Payout Criterion.

If the person leaves the role due to death (i.e., if the person dies while holding the role), all contracts on the person may resolve to the last fair price as determined in the sole discretion of the Exchange. Temporary leaves of absence, suspensions, or recusals do not constitute leaving, resigning from, or retiring from the role unless the individual formally and permanently ceases to hold the position. If the person vacates the role and then re-occupies the role, the contract may settle on the initial vacation of the role.

For "leave," cessation of holding the role qualifies, including resignation, retirement, removal, expulsion, expiration of term without renewal, recall, or other means by which the individual no longer occupies the role—this includes both voluntary and involuntary early departure AND the natural expiration of a term.","subtitle":"Before Jul 1, 2027","title":"Will Keiko Fujimori be out as President of Peru before Jul 1, 2027?","yes_sub_title":"Before Jul 1, 2027"},"schema":"public-market-text/v1"}

{"public_contract":{"description":"This market will settle to Yes if Volodymyr Zelenskyy formally ceases to hold the position of President of Ukraine by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Outcome sourced from Volodymyr Zelenskyy and the government of Ukraine.

Zelenskyy must formally cease to hold the specified position in accordance with the laws, rules, or procedures applicable to that position. Announcements of a future departure do not qualify. The means of departure do not impact settlement; resignation, removal, dismissal, replacement by a successor who formally assumes the position, or other means all qualify.

Temporary leaves of absence, dated suspensions, indefinite suspensions, administrative leaves, or other temporary changes to the specified person's duties in the specified position do not qualify.","endDate":"2027-07-15T03:00:00Z","question":"Zelenskyy Officially Out as Ukraine President?","title":"By December 31, 2026"},"schema":"public-market-text/v1"}
